  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.0.3\n- Changed the return value from 'void' to 'IDataRow' in the Add method of IDataRow\n- Mark the Add(String) method of IDataRow as obsolete and recommend using Add(Object) instead.\nVersion 3.0.2\nFix: In `Messages`, the implementation of the methods `Add` and `AddRange` has been adjusted to correctly use the base class.\nVersion 3.0.1\n- Updated some NuGet packages to their latest versions.\n- Introduction of the `Services` class in the `netaera.Reflection` namespace for instantiating objects..\nVersion 3.0.0\n- Some changes to the signatures of the IMessages interface to maintain compliance.\t\t\t\nVersion 2.2.11\n- Add some Extensions for generic Lists: GetElementOrDefaultSafe, GetElementOrNullSafe, GetElementOrNullSafeRef",
